{"id": "55835", "title": "囚禁你，蹂躏你", "author": "让宝儿飞", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 34, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/55/55835.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／其他／一般言情／正剧\r\n\r\n关键字：高/H　虐恋 　其他\r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n你想玩游戏吗？ “你，爱上我了吗？”她跪在他的腿间，嘴角调皮地扬起，像个恶作剧的小孩。\r\n一个让他们全部陷入的游戏。她拉开他的裤链，那里已经高高地挺起。她伸出舌头轻舔著，他的身子微微地颤抖。\r\n一个让他们全部毁灭的游戏。\r\n她张嘴将他的欲望含进嘴里，有技巧地吸吮著。细嫩的小手还不时前后抚摸著他的囊袋。\r\n你，将得到最后的胜利。\r\n仇恨的花蕾……\r\n在慢慢萌芽……\r\n最终，将结成……\r\n报复的甜果……", "base": "files/article/html/55/55835", "chapters": [{"title": "Chapter_1 1.玩具（高H，NP，慎）", "file": "7733810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2.幕起1（清水）", "file": "7733811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3.幕起2（小H）", "file": "7733814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4.幕起3（高H，慎）", "file": "7733815.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5.幕起4（高H，NP，慎）", "file": "7733819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6.她的小喵（微H，NP，慎）", "file": "7733820.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7.噩梦的延续（微H）", "file": "7733821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8.她的屈服（H）", "file": "7733824.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情人节献礼：番外1", "file": "7733826.html", "available": false}, {"title": "情人节献礼：番外2（高H，NP）", "file": "7733828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9.我喜欢你（H）", "file": "7733832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10.莫奚悠", "file": "7733834.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11.把他还给我", "file": "7733835.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter_2", "file": "7733837.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19.夜色缠绵（H）", "file": "7733840.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27.绑架1", "file": "7733841.html", "available": false}, {"title": "他和他：番外4", "file": "7733848.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31.心意", "file": "7733851.html", "available": false}, {"title": "34.同居吗？", "file": "7733853.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40.转变-48", "file": "7733856.html", "available": false}, {"title": "49-57", "file": "7733862.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外1", "file": "7733865.ht